  "product_overview": "Merakí is a comprehensive mobile booking platform for beauty and wellness professionals and their clients. It provides a premium, modern UX with sophisticated dark themes and glassmorphic effects, enabling clients to discover, book, and communicate with service providers, while allowing Masters to manage their schedules, earnings, and client interactions. Platform administrators maintain full oversight and management capabilities.",
