    "Unify appointment management for clients and Masters in the beauty and wellness industry.",
    "Provide secure, streamlined booking, rescheduling, and payment pre-authorization workflows.",
    "Improve communication between clients, Masters, and platform owners via in-app messaging and push notifications.",
    "Deliver a premium, intuitive user experience with a modern UI theme and smooth animations.",
    "Support business growth by providing Masters with analytics, availability management, and earnings tracking.",
    "Implement robust security with role-based access control and secure token storage.",
    "Enable platform administrators to manage users, products, and the educational Academy system."
