    "Role-based user access: Client, Master, Owner with tailored features and permissions.",
    "Complete booking flow including service browsing, master selection, real-time availability, and appointment creation.",
    "Advanced appointment management for Masters: confirm, decline, complete, no-show, reschedule with client approval.",
    "Integrated push notifications for appointments, reminders, messages, marketing, and aftercare instructions.",
